<!-- End 1-001: Divider --> </td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><!-- Start 1-008: Paragraph | P1 --><section id="1008_p1" layout-row="true"><div layout-row="true"><table layout-row="true" role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF"> <tbody><tr layout-row="true"> <td valign="top" align="left"> <table role="presentation" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" class="wrap"> <tbody><tr> <td align="left" style="padding: 0px 20px 16px 20px" class="pad20rl match"><p style="font-size: 14px; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; line-height: 150%; margin: 0px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: 0px; text-transform: none; color: #333333; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" enable-personalization="true" data-richtext="p1_text" data-groupid="p1" class="mobile_match"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 150%;"><strong>On McKinsey.com.</strong> McKinsey Health Institute (MHI) research <a href="https://email.mckinsey.com/mhi/our-insights/the-future-is-shared-financing-task-sharing-programs-in-mental-health?__hScId__=v710000019e8bed86e5b63234f4bbcfb648&__hRlId__=f45f1964d7a2411e0000021ef3a0bcd6&__hDId__=f45f1964-d7a2-411e-aca9-279aafe2d348&__hSD__=d3d3Lm1ja2luc2V5LmNvbQ==&cid=mgp_opr-eml-nsl-omcknsl-mgp-glb--&hlkid=3f1a7401318245bfb9873be3175b6dee&hctky=17208988&hdpid=f45f1964-d7a2-411e-aca9-279aafe2d348" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: inherit; background: none; text-decoration: none;" data-link-id="f701d9205e8911f1b3cdeda3da316975"><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 150%; color: rgb(34, 81, 255);">shows</span></a> that bringing care closer to everyday life can help scale mental healthcare solutions. In Santiago, Chile, MHI has worked with local organizations to <a href="https://email.mckinsey.com/mhi/health-in-cities/scaling-mental-health-where-life-happens-helping-santiago-thrive-across-the-lifespan?__hScId__=v710000019e8bed86e5b63234f4bbcfb648