iduals and family members, closing up to 45% of the gap in mental health access for target populations in the Chilean capital.<br><br><a href="https://email.mckinsey.com/mhi/health-in-cities/scaling-mental-health-where-life-happens-helping-santiago-thrive-across-the-lifespan?__hScId__=v710000019e8bed86e5b63234f4bbcfb648&__hRlId__=f45f1964d7a2411e0000021ef3a0bcdb&__hDId__=f45f1964-d7a2-411e-aca9-279aafe2d348&__hSD__=d3d3Lm1ja2luc2V5LmNvbQ==&cid=mgp_opr-eml-nsl-omcknsl-mgp-glb--&hlkid=2a5036478391470c86ed610c68eef91c&hctky=17208988&hdpid=f45f1964-d7a2-411e-aca9-279aafe2d348" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: inherit; background: none; text-decoration: none;" data-link-id="9f689a609d8111f0ae742962a556baac"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline; line-height: 150%;"><span style="color: rgb(34, 81, 255); line-height: 150%; text-decoration: underline;">Expand access to mental healthcare<img src="https://images.harmony.epsilon.com/ContentHandler/images?id=cd761513-936e-4a05-8196-6fb668e6a87c" width="20" alt="" data-mce-src="https://images.harmony.epsilon.com/ContentHandler/images?id=cd761513-936e-4a05-8196-6fb668e6a87c"></span></span></strong></a></span></p></td> </tr> </tbody></table> </td> </tr> </tbody></table> </div> </section> <!-- End 1-008: Paragraph | P1 --> </td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF"><!-- Start 1-001: Divider -->
